<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Expressway Q3 net up slightly.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Expressway Q3 net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the period ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     0.32     vs	     0.31</p>
<p>    Net			244.61     vs	   237.89</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     0.65     vs	     0.65</p>
<p>    Net			501.26     vs	   456.75</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Bangkok Expressway Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
